      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "絵を描くのすら鬱陶しくなったのか？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:75:783e71af",
      "source_hash": "783e71af",
      "sequence": 51,
      "source_line": 75,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "あ…い いや…違うんだ…！ そ その…ぼ 僕は……",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:76:d3817f73",
      "source_hash": "d3817f73",
      "sequence": 52,
      "source_line": 76,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ちょ ちょっとした理由があって…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:77:cb5cca18",
      "source_hash": "cb5cca18",
      "sequence": 53,
      "source_line": 77,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "…………",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:78:a4349b3a",
      "source_hash": "a4349b3a",
      "sequence": 54,
      "source_line": 78,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "お前な…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:79:5a5cecb2",
      "source_hash": "5a5cecb2",
      "sequence": 55,
      "source_line": 79,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "聞いてるぞ アディアに絵のレッスンつけてもらってるって",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:80:75c068bb",
      "source_hash": "75c068bb",
      "sequence": 56,
      "source_line": 80,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そっちの―――<br>画家を目指すという目的はどうするんだよ？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:81:b85205bf",
      "source_hash": "b85205bf",
      "sequence": 57,
      "source_line": 81,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そ…そうなんだけど…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:94:3ec1abf",
      "source_hash": "3ec1abf",
      "sequence": 58,
      "source_line": 94,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "私の視点から見るとな<br>何をしようとしてるのかがよくわからないんだよ お前",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:95:194e4cb0",
      "source_hash": "194e4cb0",
      "sequence": 59,
      "source_line": 95,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "師匠のバーへ行ったそうじゃないか？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:96:92120121",
      "source_hash": "92120121",
      "sequence": 60,
      "source_line": 96,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "え…え！？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:98:322b11c5",
      "source_hash": "322b11c5",
      "sequence": 61,
      "source_line": 98,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "アディアに泣きつき ソネッタに泣きつき 師匠に泣きつき<br>挙げ句の果てグラスクラフター達に泣きつき…",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:100:88aa654e",
      "source_hash": "88aa654e",
      "sequence": 62,
      "source_line": 100,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ちょっとつまづくたびに<br>すぐ他人に頼ろうとするその姿勢がどうも気に食わない",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:101:490ab029",
      "source_hash": "490ab029",
      "sequence": 63,
      "source_line": 101,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "結局なんだ？ 絵はもう上手くなりたくないのか？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:103:9c9aa0bd",
      "source_hash": "9c9aa0bd",
      "sequence": 64,
      "source_line": 103,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "な なりたいよ！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:105:25fce691",
      "source_hash": "25fce691",
      "sequence": 65,
      "source_line": 105,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "どれだけだ？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:107:43332b1f",
      "source_hash": "43332b1f",
      "sequence": 66,
      "source_line": 107,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "え…ど どれだけって…？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:108:48cf3d67",
      "source_hash": "48cf3d67",
      "sequence": 67,
      "source_line": 108,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "どれだけお前は絵を描けるようになりたいのだ？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:110:8f1578e2",
      "source_hash": "8f1578e2",
      "sequence": 68,
      "source_line": 110,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そ そんなのどうやって形容すれば…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:112:a8f4b597",
      "source_hash": "a8f4b597",
      "sequence": 69,
      "source_line": 112,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "形容？？ 成し遂げたいことがあるのに<br>自分の不甲斐なさのせいで達成できないんだぞ？？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:113:b8cafdf7",
      "source_hash": "b8cafdf7",
      "sequence": 70,
      "source_line": 113,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "これ以上の屈辱が世に存在するのか？<br>少なくとも私には想像がつかない",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:115:76c94cda",
      "source_hash": "76c94cda",
      "sequence": 71,
      "source_line": 115,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "………っ！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:117:a64a5c90",
      "source_hash": "a64a5c90",
      "sequence": 72,
      "source_line": 117,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "それなのにお前はどうだ？<br>死に物狂いで目標に向かって努力してるのか？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:119:e2586127",
      "source_hash": "e2586127",
      "sequence": 73,
      "source_line": 119,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ち 違う！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:120:75531841",
      "source_hash": "75531841",
      "sequence": 74,
      "source_line": 120,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なら答えろ<br>なぜ 私はお前の面をこうも頻繁に目にする？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:121:efa37781",
      "source_hash": "efa37781",
      "sequence": 75,
      "source_line": 121,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "え…え…？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:122:e1195c1e",
      "source_hash": "e1195c1e",
      "sequence": 76,
      "source_line": 122,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "目的があるのだろう？<br>美しい女達の絵を描き上げるという？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:123:7e53ca20",
      "source_hash": "7e53ca20",
      "sequence": 77,
      "source_line": 123,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ならなぜ 日々 意識がある間の全ての時間を<br>絵に向けていない？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:124:45b496e5",
      "source_hash": "45b496e5",
      "sequence": 78,
      "source_line": 124,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なぜ 止り木で友人達とダベってる時間なんてものが<br>存在している？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:126:345c1dd9",
      "source_hash": "345c1dd9",
      "sequence": 79,
      "source_line": 126,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そ それは…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:128:3a6afe9f",
      "source_hash": "3a6afe9f",
      "sequence": 80,
      "source_line": 128,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "リーディングストーンからヒントを得た だ？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:129:e6499d53",
      "source_hash": "e6499d53",
      "sequence": 81,
      "source_line": 129,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なぜ 古書の解読のような遊戯に時間を潰している？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:131:41790538",
      "source_hash": "41790538",
      "sequence": 82,
      "source_line": 131,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "い いや それはち ちが…！！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:133:f1948401",
      "source_hash": "f1948401",
      "sequence": 83,
      "source_line": 133,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なぜお前の目的を出し抜いて<br>これら無駄な時間の過ごし方が 優先されているんだ？？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:135:b7338570",
      "source_hash": "b7338570",
      "sequence": 84,
      "source_line": 135,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "だ…だって…そ その……",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:137:2b68094f",
      "source_hash": "2b68094f",
      "sequence": 85,
      "source_line": 137,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "………",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:139:5e9054df",
      "source_hash": "5e9054df",
      "sequence": 86,
      "source_line": 139,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "アディアは…稀だが自分の才能のなさを嘆くことがある",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:140:34d3729f",
      "source_hash": "34d3729f",
      "sequence": 87,
      "source_line": 140,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "後輩に成績で追い抜かれる…<br>ひょっとすると自分に向いていないかもしれない",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:141:9676cc75",
      "source_hash": "9676cc75",
      "sequence": 88,
      "source_line": 141,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そんな恐怖を全て受け入れ<br>毎日笑顔でファリンを漕いでいる",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:142:df172733",
      "source_hash": "df172733",
      "sequence": 89,
      "source_line": 142,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なぜだかわかるか？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:143:5acb58ed",
      "source_hash": "5acb58ed",
      "sequence": 90,
      "source_line": 143,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "え…え…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:155:250a1a9b",
      "source_hash": "250a1a9b",
      "sequence": 91,
      "source_line": 155,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "好きで好きでしょうがないからだ",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:156:962a41ee",
      "source_hash": "962a41ee",
      "sequence": 92,
      "source_line": 156,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ファリンに乗り 様々な人々と出会い 水路の水を浄化し…<br>国の生命線を守るファリナーという仕事が",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:157:fd6c251b",
      "source_hash": "fd6c251b",
      "sequence": 93,
      "source_line": 157,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "悩んでる時間やうじうじしている時間は<br>彼女にとって全て無駄な時間なんだ",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:158:a65fefb7",
      "source_hash": "a65fefb7",
      "sequence": 94,
      "source_line": 158,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そんな彼女の空き時間を<br>お前は奪っている自覚はあるのか？",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:172:35efd5ca",
      "source_hash": "35efd5ca",
      "sequence": 95,
      "source_line": 172,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ぐぐ…ゅ…そ それは…！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:173:2c948bb",
      "source_hash": "2c948bb",
      "sequence": 96,
      "source_line": 173,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "師匠は 講師時代の話はしたがらない",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:174:b3440c07",
      "source_hash": "b3440c07",
      "sequence": 97,
      "source_line": 174,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "移住時に辛いことが沢山あったらしい―――<br>それをお前は無神経にほりかえした",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:176:fd5ac9a7",
      "source_hash": "fd5ac9a7",
      "sequence": 98,
      "source_line": 176,
      "speaker_id": "kaj",
      "speaker_name": "카지",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "え…そ そんなの わかるはず………！！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch02-17:183:17c6174e",
      "source_hash": "17c6174e",
      "sequence": 99,
      "source_line": 183,
      "speaker_id": "rit",
      "speaker_name": "리토나",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "例えば――",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    }
  ]
}
